{"seq":4,"slug":"semantics-pragmatics","title":"语义学与语用学","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 语义学与语用学 简介\n\n语义学与语用学研究语言的意义层面，是语言学中与理解和交际最直接相关的领域。语义学探索词汇和句子的字面意义及其组合规律，语用学则关注语言在具体语境中的使用方式和交际意图。两者互补构成了对语言意义的完整认识。\n\n本手册面向语言学专业学生和对意义研究感兴趣的读者，系统讲解从词义分析到语用推理的核心理论与方法。读者将理解语言意义的多个层面以及语境如何影响理解与交际。\n\n全书共分为三章，从词汇到语境逐步深入：\n\n第一章**词汇语义学**从词的意义入手，讲解同义、反义、上下义等词义关系与语义场理论，分析多义与同音现象的区分方法，并介绍词汇分解与语义原子的形式化分析路径。\n\n第二章**句子语义**进入句子层面的意义研究，阐述组合语义学如何通过部分意义推导整体意义，讲解真值条件语义学与命题逻辑的基本框架，并讨论量化表达与指称理论的核心问题。\n\n第三章**语用理论**从语义跨入语用，介绍奥斯汀和塞尔的言语行为理论，讲解格赖斯的会话含义与合作原则，并阐述关联理论如何解释语用推理的认知机制。\n\n建议读者按照词汇、句子、语境的顺序循序学习，在掌握形式语义基础后深入语用分析，注重理论与日常语言交际实例的结合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lexical-semantics","title":"词汇语义学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/lexical-semantics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"word-meaning","title":"词义关系","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/lexical-semantics/word-meaning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"polysemy-homonymy","title":"多义与同音异义","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/lexical-semantics/polysemy-homonymy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lexical-decomposition","title":"词汇分解与语义原子","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/lexical-semantics/lexical-decomposition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sentence-meaning","title":"句子语义","docCount":3,"url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/sentence-meaning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compositional-semantics","title":"组合语义学","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/sentence-meaning/compositional-semantics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"truth-conditions","title":"真值条件语义学","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/sentence-meaning/truth-conditions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantification-reference","title":"量化与指称","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/sentence-meaning/quantification-reference"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmatic-theory","title":"语用理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/pragmatic-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"speech-acts","title":"言语行为理论","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/pragmatic-theory/speech-acts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"conversational-implicature","title":"会话含义理论","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/pragmatic-theory/conversational-implicature"},{"seq":3,"slug":"relevance-theory","title":"关联理论","url":"/h/linguistics/semantics-pragmatics/pragmatic-theory/relevance-theory"}]}]}